/* Generated by tools/gen_gift_table.py -- do not edit by hand.
 *
 * Every loved gift per social NPC, in Simplified Chinese, with the sprite
 * index into Game1.objectSpriteSheet (384x624, 24 columns of 16x16).
 * Universal loves are appended after the NPC's own list, which is what
 * GiftTasteHelper does by default -- they are real gifts, just not
 * personal ones.
 *
 * Items that carry their own Texture, resolve to a token id, or have a
 * name longer than six characters are skipped: the first two cannot be
 * addressed through the standard sheet, the third would widen the box
 * past the screen.
 *
 * `id` is the game's own item id, the key Farmer.giftedItems uses to
 * record what has already been given to an NPC.
 * `personal` counts the NPC's own loves; the rest are the universal
 * ones, which GiftTasteHelper appends after them.
 */
